{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id978751427"}, "name":{"label":"ryangoslingfan101"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-12T09:21:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.0"}, "id":{"label":"12534993550"}, "title":{"label":"Love the idea of this app except for this bug"}, "content":{"label":"I dumbified my phone yesterday and am already enjoying a more unplugged life. My phone brings me significantly less joy than before. There is one problem I’m experiencing that has me annoyed though and it’s that every time I open an app through the widget, the dumbify app opens up first and then it goes to the app I wanted. It annoys me that it doesn’t just automatically open the app like a good widget. I don’t like seeing dumbify pop up every time I want to do something on my phone. I didn’t pay $5 to be annoyed all the time.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6480082872&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"7"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"8"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id475486939"}, "name":{"label":"EliteMicah"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-08T15:42:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.0"}, "id":{"label":"12520258830"}, "title":{"label":"Love the minimalism!"}, "content":{"label":"I was inspired by the light phone 2 which had such a simple layout that I really wanted but didn’t want to switch to android. After watching a YouTube video, I found dumbify basically does all that I wanted from the light phone 2 and put it on iPhone! The widgets trick is genius! Definitely recommend as it helps the iPhone be less time wasting!\n\nLast edit: I wish the app would have a time widget so I can see the current date &or time. Also, idk if it’s possibly because it’s probably an IOS limitation, but having a the phone app be a default (already having the url scheme so I can add it to the widget) would be nice. Avoiding shortcuts app is a must. If that gets fixed, this is an automatic 5 star!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6480082872&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
